      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HERE COMES BILLY (7) was strongly supported last start when a short priced favourite and duly saluted winning by one length at this track in a handy 24.28. Wide box to overcome but goes well over this trip. Expected to measure up again. MI AMIGO DIABLO (2) turned in a fair 4th placed finish last time at this track over 435m (24.32). Has a strong record out of this box with two wins and a minor placing from five starts. Should be about the mark. LAKEVIEW LIAM (1) comes here following a placing in quick time (25.81) over 460m at Warragul when beaten a nose in a Grade 4/5. In form and must include in calculations. ELIJAH ROSE (5) warrants respect with the drop in distance.",
